## 1. Executive Summary: The Path to Profitability

The MedSync Health Sales Playbook 2025 outlines the strategy, targets, and operational framework for the coming fiscal year, focusing on driving high-value, sustainable growth. Following a successful Series D funding round in June 2024, our focus shifts to leveraging our market leadership in the Healthcare Technology sector to achieve operational profitability.

In FY 2024, MedSync Health achieved a total revenue of **AED 485,100,000**, maintaining a strong **75.0% Gross Margin**. While we are currently operating at a **-4.1% Operating Margin**, the 2025 strategy is designed to close this gap by targeting larger hospital systems and expanding the adoption of our high-growth product, MedSync Compliance Suite. Our robust **Net Revenue Retention (NRR) of 118%** confirms the strong value proposition and expansion potential within our existing base of **3,930 customer organizations**.

